id: og_bunkering_b
name: Bunkering Wharf II
description: Bunkering Wharf. Lanes between tanks nobody would want to shoot, a jetty at the end of them, and a pipe gallery underneath that goes where the lanes do not. Built as a marine fuel terminal; a transfer was stopped part way and the bund is half full.

